 "name_en": "Manual Transportation Planning – Basic TM (7IV)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Manual Transportation Planning – Basic TM (7IV)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiod1fb96e284bf4678ad73204e10be6be8\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiod1fb96e284bf4678ad73204e10be6be8__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">Manual transportation planning allows you to create or change a transportation plan. To create a transportation plan, you assign transportation demands (such as freight unit stages) to transportation capacities (such as equipment types, for example, truck types, rail car types, or container types). Please note that the freight units are created only after you create deliveries for purchase orders/sales orders etc.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiod1fb96e284bf4678ad73204e10be6be8__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loiod1fb96e284bf4678ad73204e10be6be8__ul_hty_1dn_ccc\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Manual Transportation Planning for Freight Order</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform Subcontracting</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Receive confirmation for Transportation from Carrier</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiod1fb96e284bf4678ad73204e10be6be8__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Support your company's transportation planning in SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Reduce freight costs with early transportation planning capabilities based on orders</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Get fewer delivery changes during logistics execution with late delivery creation based on the transportation plan and warehouse activity closeness</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Improve on-time deliveries</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>手动运输计划 – 基本 TM (7IV)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiod1fb96e284bf4678ad73204e10be6be8\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiod1fb96e284bf4678ad73204e10be6be8__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">手动运输计划允许您创建或更改运输计划。要创建运输计划，请将运输需求（例如货运单位阶段）分配到运输容量（例如设备类型，例如卡车类型、铁路车类型或集装箱类型）。请注意，只有在为采购订单/销售订单等创建交货后，才会创建货运单位。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiod1fb96e284bf4678ad73204e10be6be8__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loiod1fb96e284bf4678ad73204e10be6be8__ul_hty_1dn_ccc\">\n       <li class=\"li\">货运订单的手动运输计划</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行转包</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">从运输公司接收运输确认</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiod1fb96e284bf4678ad73204e10be6be8__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">在 SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition 中支持公司的运输计划</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">借助基于订单的早期运输计划功能，降低货运成本</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">通过基于运输计划和仓库活动的延迟交货创建，减少物流执行期间的交货更改</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">提高按时交付率</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
